{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An idle game where you raise mysterious creatures called &quot;Tasmon&quot; on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947070/extras/10058435ec5c3cfb2873653fe1594445.avif?t=1765470132\" width=100 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tasmons hatch from a mysterious egg on a small island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until the egg hatches, do what you like, or you must. The appearance and abilities of the Tasmon that hatches will depend on your actions on the PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even after your Tasmon hatches, you don't need to constantly monitor them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply feed them between tasks or games, and play with them during breaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you're doing something else, they'll go for walks and sleep on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time in this game only advances while you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On days when your PC is off, Tasmon can also rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947070/extras/aec877d050daeff55f000f2dadf92bc3.avif?t=1765470132\" width=800 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liven up your desktop by raising a wide variety of Tasmons, and relax with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Tasmon's powers will increase little by little depending on the type of food they eat and how you care for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once they're strong enough, you can even make them fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles don't require complex controls and are mostly automatic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's raise a powerful Tasmon!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947070?t=1765470132","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947070?t=1765470132","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947070/620281524e9349aaf3484adbdffe9b0184d8fade/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765470132","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947070/620281524e9349aaf3484adbdffe9b0184d8fade/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765470132","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3974610,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An idle game where you raise mysterious creatures called &quot;Tasmon&quot; on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947070/extras/10058435ec5c3cfb2873653fe1594445.avif?t=1765470132\" width=100 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tasmons hatch from a mysterious egg on a small island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until the egg hatches, do what you like, or you must. The appearance and abilities of the Tasmon that hatches will depend on your actions on the PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even after your Tasmon hatches, you don't need to constantly monitor them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply feed them between tasks or games, and play with them during breaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you're doing something else, they'll go for walks and sleep on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time in this game only advances while you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On days when your PC is off, Tasmon can also rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947070/extras/aec877d050daeff55f000f2dadf92bc3.avif?t=1765470132\" width=800 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liven up your desktop by raising a wide variety of Tasmons, and relax with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Tasmon's powers will increase little by little depending on the type of food they eat and how you care for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once they're strong enough, you can even make them fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles don't require complex controls and are mostly automatic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's raise a powerful Tasmon!</p>","developers":["Rusimitu Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947070/cbf517ffd96f7428582d13f7b6500f59079e9986/header.jpg?t=1765470132","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Rusimitu Games","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Desktop Mascot ~ Tasmon's Little Island","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8, 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Rusimitu Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated"